  body: |
    # Hardship needs and evidence in the ESA source

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source separates hardship about immediate basic necessities from the work capability assessment and requires reasons and evidence for the hardship decision.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 53140–53152 describe reduced-rate ESA(IR) hardship payments with conditions, claim and evidence requirements. Financial hardship is not LCW/LCWRA, and a WCA finding alone does not establish hardship payment entitlement.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 53140, PDF page 31](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=31)
    - [DMG 53141, PDF page 31](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=31)
    - [DMG 53150, PDF page 32](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=32)
    - [DMG 53151, PDF page 32](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=32)
    - [DMG 53152, PDF page 32](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6895ca2fa6eb81a3f9b2e29b/dmg-ch-53.pdf#page=32)

    ## Evidence and review status

    This is an unreviewed, model-assisted interpretation of selected passages in the frozen DWP guidance. It is an independent experimental publication, not an official DWP document, an entitlement decision or an executable benefits rule. ESA(Cont), ESA(IR), New Style ESA, UC and Pension Credit are not equated. The captured source contains historical, transitional and potentially superseded provisions; no complete or current legal rule set is claimed. Machine extraction can affect reading order, footnotes and characters. No visual PDF review or specialist acceptance is claimed.

    Source captured: 2026-09-15T19:45:30.951851Z. This is an acquisition time, not a publication, revision or commencement date. Source-stated dates retain their own role and precision.

